l to that card's mana value.", 'When Phyrexian Gargantua enters the battlefield, you draw two cards and you lose 2 life.', "When Spine of Ish Sah enters the battlefield, destroy target permanent.\nWhen Spine of Ish Sah is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Spine of Ish Sah to its owner's hand.", "When Spitebellows leaves the battlefield, it deals 6 damage to target creature.\nEvoke {1}{R}{R} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", 'When Sprouting Thrinax dies, create three 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens.', "When Walker of the Grove leaves the battlefield, create a 4/4 green Elemental creature token.\nEvoke {4}{G} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", 'When you cast this spell, create X 0/1 red Kobold creature tokens named Kobolds of Kher Keep, where X is the amount of mana spent to cast it.\nFlying\nSacrifice another creature: Prossh, Skyraider of Kher gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'When you cast this spell, each player reveals the top card of their library. Naya Soulbeast enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it, where X is the total mana value of all cards revealed this way.\nTrample', 'Whenever Augury Adept deals combat damage to a player, reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. You gain life equal to its mana value.', 'Whenever Diviner Spirit deals combat damage to a player, you and that player each draw that many cards.', 'Whenever Fell Shepherd deals combat damage to a player, you may return to your hand all creature cards that were put into your graveyard from the battlefield this turn.\n{B}, Sacrifice another creature: Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.', "Whenever Serene Master blocks, exchange its power and the power of target creature it's blocking until end of combat.", 'Whenever Terra Ravager attacks, it gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the