", 'Whenever you gain life, target opponent loses that much life.', 'Whenever you gain life, you may pay {1}{W}. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature for each 1 life you gained.', 'Whenever you gain life, you may pay {X}, where X is less than or equal to the amount of life you gained. If you do, draw X cards.', 'Whenever you sacrifice another permanent, you may pay {2}. If you do, Furnace Celebration deals 2 damage to any target.', "Whenever you're dealt damage, put that many charge counters on Sun Droplet.\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, you may remove a charge counter from Sun Droplet. If you do, you gain 1 life.", "Wight of Precinct Six gets +1/+1 for each creature card in your opponents' graveyards.", 'You gain 2 life. Then if you have more life than an opponent, draw a card.\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', 'You may activate abilities of creatures you control as though those creatures had haste.\n{1}, {T}: Untap target creature.', 'You may choose new targets for target instant or sorcery spell. Then copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'You may choose not to untap Rubinia Soulsinger during your untap step.\n{T}: Gain control of target creature for as long as you control Rubinia and Rubinia remains tapped.', '{1}, Exile two creature cards from a single graveyard: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', "{1}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain life equal to the sacrificed creature's toughness.", '{1}, Sacrifice a nontoken artifact: Create a 1/1 blue Thopter artifact creature token with flying. You gain 1 life.', '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{U}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{W}.', '{1}: Target creature with power 5 or greater gains first strike until end of turn.', '{1}{B}, Pay 2 life: Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{1}{R}, Sacrifice a creature: Blood Rites deals 2 damage to any target.', '{1}{U}{R}: Draw a card, then discard a card.\n{2}{U}{R}: Copy target instant or sorcery spell you control. You may choose new targets for the copy.', '{1}{W}{B}: Target creature gains lifelink until end of turn.\n{1}{W}{B}: Whenever you gain life this turn, each opponent loses that much life.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Armillary Sphere: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Wayfarer's Bauble: Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.", "{2}, {T}: Reveal the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token. If it's a land card, put that card onto the battlefield under your control. If it's a noncreature, nonland card, you gain 2 life.", '{2}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Each other player sacrifices a creature.\n{2}{R}, Sacrifice an artifact: Each other player sacrifices an artifact.\n{2}{G}, Sacrifice an enchantment: Each other player sacrifices an enchantment.', '{2}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', "{2}{W}{U}: Exile target creature. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", '{3}, Sacrifice a creature: Draw a card.', "{3}, {T}: Tap target creature you control and target creature of an opponent's choice they control. Those creatures fight each other. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", '{3}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.\n{3}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{3}{R}{G}{W}, {T}: Look at the top five cards of your library. You may put a creature card with power 5 or greater from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', '{4}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\n{4}{G}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', '{4}{G}, Sacrifice a creature: Destroy target creature with flying.', '{8}, {T}: Draw four cards.', '{B}, Pay 2 life: Draw a card.', '{G}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Destroy target enchantment.', '{R}: Inferno Titan gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\nWhenever Inferno Titan enters the battlefield or attacks, it deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three targets.', "{T}, Exile Surveyor's Scope: Search your library for up to X basic land cards, where X is the number of players who control at least two more lands than you. Put those cards onto the battlefield, then shuffle.", '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}, Sacrifice Nihil Spellbomb: Exile target player's graveyard.\nWhen Nihil Spellbomb is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may pay {B}. If you do, draw a card.", '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Destroy target nonblack creature.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", '{T}: Add {B}, {R}, or {G}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Bant Panorama: Search your library for a basic Forest, Plains, or Island card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Esper Panorama: Search your library for a basic Plains, Island, or Swamp card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Grixis Panorama: Search your library for a basic Island, Swamp, or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Jund Panorama: Search your library for a basic Swamp, Mountain, or Forest card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Naya Panorama: Search your library for a basic Mountain, Forest, or Plains card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity. If you spend this mana to cast your commander, it enters the battlefield with a number of additional +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number of times it's been cast from the command zone this game.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Molten Slagheap.\n{1}, Remove X storage counters from Molten Slagheap: Add X mana in any combination of {B} and/or {R}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Saltcrusted Steppe.\n{1}, Remove X storage counters from Saltcrusted Steppe: Add X mana in any combination of {G} and/or {W}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}{R}, {T}: Create a 0/1 red Kobold creature token named Kobolds of Kher Keep.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{4}, {T}: Create a 0/1 white Goat creature token.\n{T}, Sacrifice X Goats: Add X mana of any one color. You gain X life.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{7}, {T}: Create a 2/2 colorless Assembly-Worker artifact creature token.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{R}{G}, {T}: Target Beast creature you control fights target creature an opponent controls. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Each player gains control of all creatures they own.', '{T}: Add {C}. You gain 1 life.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {U}, {B}, or {R}.', '{T}: Add {W} or {U}.\n{W}{U}: Azorius Keyrune becomes a 2/2 white and blue Bird artifact creature with flying until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {W}, {U}, or {B}.', '{T}: Each player draws a card.', '{T}: Put target creature card from your graveyard on top of your library. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', '{U}, {T}: Each player discards their hand, then draws cards equal to the greatest number of cards a player discarded this way.', '{U}: Target noncreature artifact becomes an artifact creature with power and toughness each equal to its mana value until end of turn.\n{W}{B}: Target artifact creature gains deathtouch and lifelink until end of turn.', "{X}{R}: This turn, creatures can't block unless their controller pays {X} for each blocking creature they control.", '{X}{X}{1}: Destroy target artifact or creature with mana value X.']
